OVIE","url":"","style":{"image":"https://cloud01.albox.co/shows/a1ea39d8-c8d1-4e43-b47e-b495dd337dee.jpg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Related","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":11913,"title":"","description":"24","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Fantasy","Sci-Fi","Drama","Thriller","Mystery"],"id":11913,"type":"MOVIE","title":"The Jacket","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk44/shows/61b63688-5cc4-40fa-a460-303a5b679ab3.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk55/shows/cf456ec9-d48e-4661-8c31-fc87ccf00fd6.jpg","likes":117,"dislikes":2,"views":10533,"release_date":"1109894400000","length":6175,"description":"The film centers on a wounded Gulf war veteran who returns to his native Vermont suffering from bouts of amnesia. He is hitching and gets picked up by a stranger, things go pear shaped when a cop pulls them over and is murdered by the stranger. The vet. is wrongly accused of killing the cop and lands up in an asylum. A quack doctor prescribes a course of experimental therapy, restraining him in a heavy duty straight jacket-like device, and locks him away in a body drawer of the basement morgue. During course of his treatment he gets flashbacks and visions of his future , where he can foresee he is to die in four days time. The catch is he doesn't know how. Thus commences the classic race against time.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.1}],"value":7.1,"age":"R"},"episode_id":11913,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}